  "3e1548c0-1050-4b2d-8e5d-6f6065ce729d"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a scene solved on a graph, step by step; a List of bindings, one per \
admissible combination"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"417af720-09a1-47bc-b063-38965d89bac6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
