  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "c2c8d371-f060-4d80-871d-ebcc98d50162"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one solved binding of a scene; with an object name, reads that object out \
of it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"bc8f46c1-5046-47dd-bd6f-1fbcbc0877a9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
